{"title":"Mammoth Bull","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 53 Mammoth that attacks with crush (melee). It will not attack first.</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (20.0% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=53\" title=\"Pick level 53\"><td><b>53</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>344</td><td>33.7</td><td>2,650</td><td class=\"muted\">1,032 · 47.2 · 7,950</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 518, -844</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>54</b></td><td>358</td><td>34.2</td><td>2,700</td><td class=\"muted\">1,074 · 47.9 · 8,100</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 524, -844</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/mammoth-bull?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>1</td><td>in the wilds around 373, -1066</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mammoth-bull\" data-map-level=\"54\">Show level 54 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-3753.8px,445.2px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/13/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3328px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/14/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3584px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-768px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/15/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:3840px;top:-512px\"><i style=\"left:3739.7px;top:-380.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:3762.0px;top:-438.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:3745.6px;top:-452.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:3746.1px;top:-400.4px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 520, -845 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 373, -1066 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 541, -819 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 535, -827 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"mammoth-bull\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Mammoth: <a href=\"#/monster/tundra-mammoth\">Tundra Mammoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/woolly-mammoth\">Woolly Mammoth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(52)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b69164761a3a8589c5ea.svg\" alt=\"Mammoth Bull\"></div><h3>Mammoth Bull</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>54</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 53)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Mammoth</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>358</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>34.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,700</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>3.65</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}